{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/cc_eng_chaper01.png?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/Cloud_cats_idol.gif?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a shipwreck, you find yourself on a mysterious island that isn\u2019t marked on any map. Yet, standing tall on this enigmatic island is a lighthouse - our only path to salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cloud Cats are friendly and playful creatures that warmly welcome new guests. However, what happened to the lighthouse keeper? And are the kittens truly innocent in his disappearance?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/cc_eng_chaper02.png?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/whoosh_and_you_have_a_multipass.gif?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each cat is unique and brings its own magic to your journey. Attract kittens to solve puzzles, and they will assist you on your unforgettable adventure.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/cc_eng_chaper03.png?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/shoggoth_also_likes_icecream.gif?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your wits to find common ground with the unusual creatures you encounter along the way. Who said a shoggoth doesn't love ice cream?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/cc_eng_chaper04.png?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/make_a_railroad_out_of_a_fence.gif?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every ordinary object can be transformed into something extraordinary. Got a piece of fence? Why not turn it into some rails? They look so alike!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/cc_eng_chaper05.png?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/unlock_the_lock.gif?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every corner of the island holds secrets and unique challenges. Solve riddles with the help of magical kittens, conquer mini-games, and explore the island \u2014 perhaps you will be the one to uncover the secrets of the Cloud Cats!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3239500?t=1745376004","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3239500?t=1745376004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/0c4ab4583062fabf13e4768386028f668102124d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745376004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/0c4ab4583062fabf13e4768386028f668102124d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745376004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3255180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/cc_eng_chaper01.png?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/Cloud_cats_idol.gif?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a shipwreck, you find yourself on a mysterious island that isn\u2019t marked on any map. Yet, standing tall on this enigmatic island is a lighthouse - our only path to salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cloud Cats are friendly and playful creatures that warmly welcome new guests. However, what happened to the lighthouse keeper? And are the kittens truly innocent in his disappearance?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/cc_eng_chaper02.png?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/whoosh_and_you_have_a_multipass.gif?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each cat is unique and brings its own magic to your journey. Attract kittens to solve puzzles, and they will assist you on your unforgettable adventure.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/cc_eng_chaper03.png?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/shoggoth_also_likes_icecream.gif?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your wits to find common ground with the unusual creatures you encounter along the way. Who said a shoggoth doesn't love ice cream?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/cc_eng_chaper04.png?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/make_a_railroad_out_of_a_fence.gif?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every ordinary object can be transformed into something extraordinary. Got a piece of fence? Why not turn it into some rails? They look so alike!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/cc_eng_chaper05.png?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/unlock_the_lock.gif?t=1745376004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every corner of the island holds secrets and unique challenges. Solve riddles with the help of magical kittens, conquer mini-games, and explore the island \u2014 perhaps you will be the one to uncover the secrets of the Cloud Cats!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Ekaterina Fedorchuk"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/header.jpg?t=1745376004","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100606,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100606/movie480.mp4?t=1740096511","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100606/movie_max.mp4?t=1740096511"},"name":"Cloud Cats` Land trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.ste